  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Validating The Concept**\n\nI\'m validating the concept for a Local SEO Geo-Grid Rank Tracker and Prospecting SaaS. The focus is on implementing and validating the fundamental mechanics before committing to the full web application development. This involves a rigorous assessment of core functionalities and feasibility to ensure a strong foundation.\n\n\n**Refining Core Logic**\n\nI\'ve been focusing on refining the foundational core engine logic, specifically in TypeScript. I\'ve successfully built the coordinate grid generator function. Next, I am currently working on the DataForSEO/SERP API local maps rank parser with mocking of the SERP response. I\'m aiming to produce a useful pin scan result with appropriate color-coded ranking status.\n\n\n**Developing AI-Driven Insights**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into generating AI-driven insights. My focus is on creating a structured JSON output that delivers an `executiveSummary`, an estimated `missedRevenueEstimate`, a concise `actionPlan`, and a ready-to-use `coldOutreachPitch`. The goal is to provide agencies with actionable data for prospecting. I\'m leveraging the Gemini API and considering a responseSchema for structured output with a test workbench.\n\n\n"
