              text: "2. Formulate a realistic, quantified missed revenue estimate: according to local consumer search studies, Google\'s 3-Pack monopolizes ~70% of clicks and calls. When a business drops past position 3 (into yellow and red grid zones), inbound calls decrease exponentially."
