              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "    executiveSummary: `Our ${input.metrics.totalNodesScanned}-point geo-grid rank audit for ${input.businessName} indicates severe geographic signal decay outside your immediate 0.5-mile centroid. While your business maintains visibility directly on your street, ${weakPercent}% of the scanned service area places you at position #${Math.round(input.metrics.averageRank)} or worse. High-margin searchers just 1.5 miles away are routed almost exclusively to ${topComp} and ${secondComp}.`,"
