            lines {
              text: "    "
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "    missedRevenueEstimate: `In local search, positions 1 through 3 in the Google Local Pack capture between 68% and 74% of all high-intent phone calls and direction requests. With only ${input.metrics.top3Percentage.toFixed(1)}% of your service grid ranking in the 3-Pack, you are forfeiting approximately 45 to 60 inbound quote opportunities per month in your category (${input.category}), representing an estimated $18,000 - $32,000 in monthly gross billings diverted straight to nearby competitors.`,"
