              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "      subjectLine: `Quick question regarding ${input.businessName}\'s Google Maps reach in ${input.metrics.targetMarket || \'your area\'}`,"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "      emailBody: `Hi team at ${input.businessName},\\n\\nI was running a geo-grid visibility audit for ${input.category.toLowerCase()} providers in ${input.metrics.targetMarket || \'the metro area\'} and pulled up your live Google Maps rank radius.\\n\\nRight outside your immediate office, your ranking drops from the top 3 down to an average of #${input.metrics.averageRank.toFixed(1)} across ${weakPercent}% of your nearby service territory. \\n\\nEssentially, homeowners searching for ${input.category.toLowerCase()} just 1.5 miles out are being routed to ${topComp} and ${secondComp} simply because your proximity signals are constrained to your primary address.\\n\\nI compiled a visual 25-pin geo-map showing exactly where you are losing calls and the 4 fixes to reclaim the 3-pack across the full radius.\\n\\nWould it be okay if I forwarded the screenshot over? No obligation either way.\\n\\nBest regards,\\nLocal Growth Engineering Team`,"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
