            lines {
              text: "  executiveSummary: \"Geo-grid spatial analysis reveals significant centroid lock-in for Austin Premier Plumbing: rank drops from position #2 within 0.8 km to position #14 beyond 2.0 km. Across 25 scanned grid nodes, 84% fall into the red/yellow zone, allowing Apex Emergency Plumbing and Capital City Water Heaters to capture the majority of high-intent emergency plumbing searches.\","
