    combined_output {
      full: "<truncated 23 bytes>\nmbing.com\",\"url\":\"https://capitalcityplumbing.com\",\"phone\":\"(512) 555-0142\",\"category\":\"Plumber\"},{\"rank_position\":3,\"name\":\"Lone Star Rooter Pros\",\"place_id\":\"ChIJ_lonestar_pros_03\",\"address\":\"2200 S Lamar Blvd, Austin, TX 78704\",\"rating\":4.7,\"reviews\":189,\"domain\":\"lonestarrooter.com\",\"url\":\"https://lonestarrooter.com\",\"phone\":\"(512) 555-0188\",\"category\":\"Plumbing Service\"}],\"totalResultsScanned\":20,\"scannedAt\":\"2026-10-15T17:54:45.821Z\"}},{\"suite\":\"SERP Rank Parser\",\"name\":\"Top competitors correctly excludes the target business itself\",\"passed\":true,\"message\":\"Target business was excluded from competitor list.\",\"durationMs\":0.05,\"data\":[{\"rank_position\":1,\"name\":\"Apex Emergency Plumbing Austin\",\"place_id\":\"ChIJ_apex_plumbing_01\",\"address\":\"1024 Congress Ave, Austin, TX 78701\",\"rating\":4.9,\"reviews\":342,\"domain\":\"apexplumbingaustin.com\",\"url\":\"https://apexplumbingaustin.com\",\"phone\":\"(512) 555-0199\",\"category\":\"Plumber\"},{\"rank_position\":3,\"name\":\"Lone Star Rooter Pros\",\"place_id\":\"ChIJ_lonestar_pros_03\",\"address\":\"2200 S Lamar Blvd, Austin, TX 78704\",\"rating\":4.7,\"reviews\":189,\"domain\":\"lonestarrooter.com\",\"url\":\"https://lonestarrooter.com\",\"phone\":\"(512) 555-0188\",\"category\":\"Plumbing Service\"},{\"rank_position\":4,\"name\":\"Reliable Austin Drain Masters\",\"place_id\":\"ChIJ_reliable_austin_04\",\"address\":\"1500 E 11th St, Austin, TX 78702\",\"rating\":4.6,\"reviews\":98,\"domain\":\"austindrainmasters.com\",\"url\":\"https://austindrainmasters.com\",\"phone\":\"(512) 555-0177\",\"category\":\"Plumber\"}]},{\"suite\":\"AI Audit & Pitch Generator\",\"name\":\"Zod schema validates sample JSON output structure\",\"passed\":true,\"message\":\"Sample JSON output adheres 100% to Zod schema specification.\",\"durationMs\":2.95,\"data\":{\"success\":true,\"data\":{\"executiveSummary\":\"Geo-grid spatial analysis reveals significant centroid lock-in for Austin Premier Plumbing: rank drops from position #2 within 0.8 km to position #14 beyond 2.0 km. Across 25 scanned grid nodes, 84% fall into the red/yellow zone, allowing Apex Emergency Plumbing and Capital City Water Heaters to capture the majority of high-intent emergency plumbing searches.\",\"missedRevenueEstimate\":\"Google Maps Local Pack (Top 3) commands 72% of mobile call clicks for emergency plumbing queries. With an overall average rank of 11.4 and only 16.0% 3-Pack presence, the business loses an estimated 55 to 70 direct calls monthly, translating to an estimated $22,000 - $35,000 in monthly missed dispatch revenue.\",\"actionPlan\":{\"gbpCategories\":\"Refine Google Business Profile categories by setting \'Plumber\' as primary and adding \'Drainage Service\', \'Water Heater Repair Service\', and \'Emergency Plumbing Service\' as secondary classifications.\",\"citations\":\"Standardize NAP across core data aggregators and build 15 hyper-local Austin business citations (Austin Chamber, local neighborhood directories) to reinforce centroid expansion.\",\"reviews\":\"Launch an automated post-job review request system encouraging verified customers to mention specific Austin zip codes and emergency services in review text.\",\"onPageLocalizedContent\":\"Publish dedicated neighborhood landing pages (e.g. South Congress, Barton Hills, Mueller) with LocalBusiness GeoCoordinates JSON-LD schemas connected directly to the GBP CID.\"},\"coldOutreachPitch\":{\"subjectLine\":\"Austin Premier Plumbing: Google Maps 25-pin grid audit\",\"emailBody\":\"Hi team,\\n\\nI generated a 25-pin local geo-grid scan for emergency plumbing searches in Austin, and noticed something interesting about Austin Premier Plumbing\'s Google Maps reach.\\n\\nWhile you rank in the top 3 right next to your dispatch shop, your visibility drops to an average of #11.4 just two miles away\342\200\224meaning Apex Emergency Plumbing and Capital City Water Heaters are getting 84% of the incoming calls in your surrounding service territory.\\n\\nI have the complete color-coded geo-grid map ready. Can I send the PDF over so you can see where your calls are dropping off?\\n\\nBest,\\nMarcus Vance\",\"smsOrVoicemailScript\":\"Hey team at Austin Premier Plumbing, Marcus here. Ran a quick 25-pin Google Maps radar audit across Austin\342\200\224you guys drop off after 1.5 miles while Apex Plumbing dominates the rest. Want me to send over the map screenshot?\"}}}},{\"suite\":\"AI Audit & Pitch Generator\",\"name\":\"Prompt generator builds complete prompt with grid metrics and competitors\",\"passed\":true,\"message\":\"Prompt dynamically constructs all required local SEO variables.\",\"durationMs\":0.28,\"data\":{\"promptSnippet\":\"You are a Principal Local SEO Specialist and Agency Prospecting Strategist analyzing an automated Geo-Grid local rank scan (similar to Local Falcon and ProfitMaps AI).\\n\\nTARGET BUSINESS PROFILE:\\n- Business Name: \\\"Austin Premier Plumbing\\\"\\n- Industry / Category: \\\"Emergency Plumber\\\"\\n- Target Location / ...\"}},{\"suite\":\"AI Audit & Pitch Generator\",\"name\":\"Deterministic generator output validates under Zod schema\",\"passed\":true,\"message\":\"Deterministic generator creates fully schema-compliant pitch and audit.\",\"durationMs\":0.23,\"data\":{\"executiveSummary\":\"Our 25-point geo-grid rank audit for Lone Star Rooter Pros indicates severe geographic signal decay outside your immediate 0.5-mile centroid. While your business maintains visibility directly on your street, 76% of the scanned service area places you at position #9 or worse. High-margin searchers just 1.5 miles away are routed almost exclusively to Apex Emergency Plumbing and Capital City Drains.\",\"missedRevenueEstimate\":\"In local search, positions 1 through 3 in the Google Local Pack capture between 68% and 74% of all high-intent phone calls and direction requests. With only 24.0% of your service grid ranking in the 3-Pack, you are forfeiting approximately 45 to 60 inbound quote opportunities per month in your category (Drain Cleaning), representing an estimated $18,000 - $32,000 in monthly gross billings diverted straight to nearby competitors.\",\"actionPlan\":{\"gbpCategories\":\"Audit primary and secondary GBP categories: Ensure your primary category precisely matches \\\"Drain Cleaning\\\" and add 3 to 5 targeted sub-categories (e.g., Emergency Services, Repair Specialists) rather than generic business labels.\",\"citations\":\"Fix name, address, and phone (NAP) discrepancies across top tier aggregators (Data Axle, Localeze, Foursquare) and sync high-relevance niche and hyper-local Austin business registries to strengthen geographic entity validation.\",\"reviews\":\"Establish an automated SMS review generation flow asking recent customers to mention specific suburbs, neighborhoods, and service keywords (e.g., \'fast water heater replacement in South Congress\') to inject natural geo-relevance into your profile.\",\"onPageLocalizedContent\":\"Deploy dedicated suburb landing pages on your website featuring embedded Google Maps, local geo-coordinates, client case studies, and schema.org/LocalBusiness structured markup linked back to your GBP CID.\"},\"coldOutreachPitch\":{\"subjectLine\":\"Quick question regarding Lone Star Rooter Pros\'s Google Maps reach in Austin, TX\",\"emailBody\":\"Hi team at Lone Star Rooter Pros,\\n\\nI was running a geo-grid visibility audit for drain cleaning providers in Austin, TX and pulled up your live Google Maps rank radius.\\n\\nRight outside your immediate office, your ranking drops from the top 3 down to an average of #8.6 across 76% of your nearby service territory. \\n\\nEssentially, homeowners searching for drain cleaning just 1.5 miles out are being routed to Apex Emergency Plumbing and Capital City Drains simply because your proximity signals are constrained to your primary address.\\n\\nI compiled a visual 25-pin geo-map showing exactly where you are losing calls and the 4 fixes to reclaim the 3-pack across the full radius.\\n\\nWould it be okay if I forwarded the screenshot over? No obligation either way.\\n\\nBest regards,\\nLocal Growth Engineering Team\",\"smsOrVoicemailScript\":\"Hey Lone Star Rooter Pros, this is Alex. I just ran a 25-pin geo-grid scan on Google Maps for Drain Cleaning in our area. You\'re crushing it within 2 blocks, but beyond 1 mile Apex Emergency Plumbing is taking 70% of the phone calls. I have a 1-page visual map showing the breakdown\342\200\224mind if I text or email it over?\"}}}]}"
    }
